  [`ConsoleMessage`](`PlaywrightEx.ConsoleMessage`) objects are dispatched by page via the [`Page.on(:console)`](PlaywrightEx.Page.html#module-console) event.
  For each console message logged in the page there will be corresponding event in the Playwright
  context.

  ```js
